# ============================================================================
#  Benchmark Manifest — Example
# ============================================================================
#
#  Format: label | database | sql_file_or_mv_table | variant
#
#  - label:              Human-readable name shown in output
#  - database:           ClickHouse database to run against
#  - sql_file_or_mv_table: Path to .sql file (relative to manifest dir or absolute)
#                          OR MV/table name (auto-detected: if file doesn't exist, treated as table)
#  - variant:            Tag for grouping results (e.g., original, optimized, dict, mv)
#
#  Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines are ignored.
#
#  Tips:
#  - Group related queries together (original then optimized)
#  - Use consistent variant names across queries for easier comparison
#  - SQL files should contain a single query (no trailing semicolons needed)
#  - MV entries auto-generate: SELECT * FROM <table> FORMAT Null
# ============================================================================

# --- Query 1: Large group rollup ---
Q1 Original  | example_db | queries/large_group_v5.sql                  | original
Q1 Optimized | example_db | queries/optimized/large_group_v5_optimized.sql | optimized
Q1 Dict      | example_db | queries/optimized/large_group_v5_dict.sql   | dict
Q1 MV        | example_db | mv_q1_large_group                          | mv

# --- Query 2: Large leaves ---
Q2 Original  | example_db | queries/large_leaves_v2.sql                 | original
Q2 Optimized | example_db | queries/optimized/large_leaves_v2_optimized.sql | optimized
Q2 MV        | example_db | mv_q2_large_leaves                         | mv

# --- Query 3: Sales chain wide ---
Q3 Original  | example_db | queries/sales_chain_large_wide.sql          | original
Q3 Optimized | example_db | queries/optimized/sales_chain_large_wide_optimized.sql | optimized
Q3 MV        | example_db | mv_q3_sales_chain_wide                     | mv

# --- Query 4: Sales chain leaf ---
Q4 Original  | example_db | queries/sales_chain_leaf_large_wide.sql     | original
Q4 Optimized | example_db | queries/optimized/sales_chain_leaf_large_wide_optimized.sql | optimized
Q4 Dict      | example_db | queries/optimized/sales_chain_leaf_dict.sql | dict
Q4 MV        | example_db | mv_q4_sales_chain_leaf_wide                | mv
